<title>EGYPT: Cairo's results for Q1 1997.</title>
<headline>Cairo's results for Q1 1997.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the end of the first quarter of calendar 1997. The company's financial year is the same as the calendar year.</p>
<p>(All figure in Egyptian pounds, no comparative figures</p>
<p>available) January to March 1997</p>
<p>Net sales 11,896,555</p>
<p>Production costs 7,191,998</p>
<p>Expenditure 2,419,234</p>
<p>Exceptional revenues 385,795</p>
<p>Net profit before tax 2,671,118</p>
<p>Full company name is Cairo Precision Industries.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom + 202 578 3290/1</p>
